{"id":"c49","kind":"web","text":"원문은 복잡하고 열린 작업에서 Opus 5.5 가 분명히 강하다고 쓴다 (02, 13, 17장)","verdict":"confirmed","scope":"w1 §Performance ¶1","evidence":[{"source":"w1","locator":"§Performance ¶1","quote":"On several evaluations, Sonnet 5.5 at Max effort even performs comparably to Opus 5.5. However, benchmark scores capture only one facet of a model’s capabilities; in our own testing, and in that of external testers, Opus 5.5 remains clearly stronger at complex, open-ended work requiring sustained judgment."}]}
{"id":"c50","kind":"web","text":"GDPval-AA 와 AA-Briefcase 는 structured outputs 버그가 있는 출시 전 배포에서 쟀다 (13, 17장)","verdict":"confirmed","scope":"w1 §Footnotes 3","evidence":[{"source":"w1","locator":"§Footnotes 3","quote":"Artificial Analysis ran GDPval-AA and AA-Briefcase on a pre-release deployment of Sonnet 5.5 on the Claude Platform, which we found to have a bug that could degrade responses to requests that use structured outputs."}]}
{"id":"c51","kind":"numeric","text":"Terminal-Bench 차트에서 Sonnet 5 는 low 3.2% 에서 max 10.3% 까지 모든 effort 에서 GPT-5.6 Sol 보다 낮다 (03장)","verdict":"confirmed","scope":"w1 Terminal-Bench chart","evidence":[{"source":"w1","locator":"chart Terminal-Bench 4.0","quote":"Sonnet 5 · High: 4.5% $8.20 / Sonnet 5 · Max: 10.3% $11.62"},{"source":"w1","locator":"chart Terminal-Bench 4.0","quote":"Opus 5.5 · Xhigh: 66.4% $7.35 / Opus 5.5 · Max: 64.8% $11.24 / Sonnet 5 · Low: 3.2% $3.78 / Sonnet 5 · Med: 4.4% $4.83 / Sonnet 5 · Xhigh: 7.0% $9.95 / GPT-5.6 Sol · Low: 7.9% $1.46 / GPT-5.6 Sol · Max: 37.3% $7.89"}]}
{"id":"c52","kind":"web","text":"Balyasny: 금융 과제 2,441개에서 답당 약 121k 토큰, Sonnet 5 는 497k (03, 16장)","verdict":"confirmed","scope":"w1 §Knowledge work · Balyasny","evidence":[{"source":"w1","locator":"§Knowledge work · Balyasny","quote":"On our private suite of 2,441 finance tasks covering Q&A, extraction, analysis, and forecasting, Claude Sonnet 5.5 scored ahead of Sonnet 5 and used about 121k tokens per answer, where Sonnet 5 used 497k."}]}
{"id":"c53","kind":"web","text":"CodeRabbit: Sonnet 5 의 잦은 web search 와 높은 토큰 사용이 사라졌다 (03, 16장)","verdict":"confirmed","scope":"w1 §Coding · CodeRabbit","evidence":[{"source":"w1","locator":"§Coding · CodeRabbit","quote":"Sonnet 5’s tendency to reach for web search too often and its high token use are both gone in this new model. We plan to move simple and moderate reviews over now, and more in the coming weeks."}]}
{"id":"c54","kind":"web","text":"Base44: 앱 118개, 빌드당 3.6회 대 Opus 5 7.7회, 실패 tool call 최소 (16장)","verdict":"confirmed","scope":"w1 §Coding · Base44","evidence":[{"source":"w1","locator":"§Coding · Base44","quote":"Across 118 real app builds, Claude Sonnet 5.5 produced apps that scored level with Opus 5. It got there in 3.6 iterations per build on average, where Opus 5 took 7.7. It had the fewest failed tool calls of any model we compared."}]}
{"id":"c55","kind":"web","text":"Slack 출력 토큰 약 14% 감소, Zendesk 20% 빠름, Box 2.4배 빠르고 토큰 12% 감소, Lovable tool call 1/3 감소, Atlassian 최대 30% 빠름, Unity 90% (16장)","verdict":"confirmed","scope":"w1 §Coding, §Knowledge work 고객 인용","evidence":[{"source":"w1","locator":"§Knowledge work · Slack","quote":"Without changing any of our prompts, Claude Sonnet 5.5 did better than Sonnet 5 on almost all of our offline Slackbot evals, in fewer steps and with about 14% fewer output tokens."},{"source":"w1","locator":"§Knowledge work · Zendesk","quote":"It made fewer wrong decisions and resolved tickets faster than the Claude models we use in production today. Tickets were processed 20% faster"},{"source":"w1","locator":"§Knowledge work · Box","quote":"Compared to the last model, Sonnet 5.5 was more accurate, 2.4x faster, and used 12% fewer total tokens."},{"source":"w1","locator":"§Knowledge work · Lovable","quote":"Our coding evals showed a third fewer tool calls and roughly half the shell runs to finish a task."},{"source":"w1","locator":"§Knowledge work · Atlassian","quote":"Claude Sonnet 5.5 will allow teams to run their Rovo Agents up to 30% faster than they could with Sonnet 5."},{"source":"w1","locator":"§Coding · Unity","quote":"The majority of Claude Sonnet 5.5’s work passed that check. It also completed 90% of tasks in our multi-step Unity Editor and coding benchmark, beating similar models."}]}
{"id":"c56","kind":"web","text":"원문은 Sonnet 5.5 가 능력의 최전선을 넓히지 않아 평가를 좁혔고 약 1,850 시나리오 감사에서 대부분 Sonnet 5 와 같거나 나았다고 쓴다 (16장)","verdict":"confirmed","scope":"w1 §Safety · Alignment","evidence":[{"source":"w1","locator":"§Safety · Alignment ¶1","quote":"Sonnet 5.5 doesn’t advance the frontier of our models’ capabilities, so our alignment assessment focused on a targeted set of risks that apply to models of any capability level"},{"source":"w1","locator":"§Safety · Alignment ¶2","quote":"On our automated behavioral audit, which tests Claude across roughly 1,850 scenarios, Sonnet 5.5 improves on or matches Sonnet 5 on most measures of alignment, resistance to misuse, and honesty."}]}
{"id":"c57","kind":"web","text":"GDPval-AA 에서 Opus 5.5 와 거의 같고 Sonnet 5 보다 약 400점 높으며 10장짜리 운영 리뷰 초안을 전문가 둘이 그대로 보내도 된다고 판단했다 (16장)","verdict":"confirmed","scope":"w1 §Knowledge work","evidence":[{"source":"w1","locator":"§Knowledge work ¶1","quote":"On GDPval-AA, which tests models on real-world tasks across 44 occupations and nine major industries, Sonnet 5.5 scores nearly level with Opus 5.5 and about 400 points above Sonnet 5."},{"source":"w1","locator":"§Knowledge work ¶2","quote":"In one internal test, we gave it a public company’s quarterly earnings materials and call transcripts, along with a slide template, and asked for a 10-slide operating review. Two experts judged its first draft to be ready to send as is."}]}
{"id":"c58","kind":"web","text":"Sonnet 4.6 이하에서 옮기면 sampling 파라미터 400 과 약 30% 많은 토큰이 더해진다 (14장)","verdict":"confirmed","scope":"d1 §Sonnet 4.6 breaking changes","evidence":[{"source":"d1","locator":"§Other changes from Sonnet 4.6","quote":"* **About 30% more tokens:** Claude Sonnet 5.5 uses Claude Sonnet 5's tokenizer. Against Claude Sonnet 4.6, Claude Sonnet 4.5, and Claude Haiku 4.5, the same text produces about 30% more tokens, depending on the content."},{"source":"d1","locator":"§Sonnet 4.6 breaking changes","quote":"**Sampling parameters return an error.** Claude Sonnet 4.6 and earlier models and Claude Haiku 4.5 accept `temperature`, `top_p`, and `top_k`. On Claude Sonnet 5.5, a non-default value returns a 400 error."}]}
{"id":"c59","kind":"web","text":"/claude-api migrate 는 모델 ID, breaking parameter, effort 조정을 적용하고 확인 목록을 만든다 (14장)","verdict":"confirmed","scope":"d1 §intro tip","evidence":[{"source":"d1","locator":"§intro tip","quote":"The skill applies the model ID swap and, as needed, breaking parameter changes, prefill replacement, and effort calibration for your target model across your code base, then produces a checklist of items to verify manually."}]}
{"id":"c60","kind":"web","text":"guide 의 예시는 disabled 에 xhigh 를 쓰던 Sonnet 5 요청을 between_tools 에 high 로 바꿔 effort 를 한 단계 내린다 (04장)","verdict":"confirmed","scope":"d1 §Turn off up-front thinking 예시","evidence":[{"source":"d1","locator":"§Turn off up-front thinking · Before example","quote":"      thinking={\"type\": \"disabled\"},\n      output_config={\"effort\": \"xhigh\"},"},{"source":"d1","locator":"§Turn off up-front thinking · After example","quote":"      thinking={\"type\": \"between_tools\"},\n      output_config={\"effort\": \"high\"},"}]}
{"id":"c61","kind":"web","text":"Sonnet 5 는 Claude API 와 Claude Code 모두 기본 effort 가 high 였다 (11장)","verdict":"confirmed","scope":"d3 §Recommended effort levels for Claude Sonnet 5","evidence":[{"source":"d3","locator":"§Recommended effort levels for Claude Sonnet 5","quote":"Claude Sonnet 5 defaults to `high` effort on the Claude API and Claude Code."}]}
{"id":"c62","kind":"web","text":"Sonnet 5.5 는 per-message effort(beta, mid-conversation-output-config-2026-07-01)로 대화 중 effort 를 바꿔도 캐시가 유지되고, 이 기능은 Sonnet 5 에 없다 (10, 14장)","verdict":"confirmed","scope":"d3, d4 §Feature support","evidence":[{"source":"d3","locator":"§Recommended effort levels for Claude Sonnet 5.5","quote":"Claude Sonnet 5.5 also supports [changing effort mid-conversation](https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/build-with-claude/effort#change-effort-mid-conversation-beta) with a per-message `output_config`, which preserves the prompt cache."},{"source":"d3","locator":"§Per-message effort (beta)","quote":"Per-message effort is in beta and requires the [beta header](https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/api/beta-headers) `mid-conversation-output-config-2026-07-01`."},{"source":"d4","locator":"§Feature support","quote":"Per-message effort, mid-conversation system messages, and mid-conversation tool changes aren't available on Claude Sonnet 5, whose minimum cacheable prompt is 1,024 tokens."}]}
{"id":"c63","kind":"web","text":"2026-08-31 이전 계정은 block_binding 필드를 보내야 검사에 들어가고, drop_block 은 beta header 와 adaptive 에서만 된다 (06장)","verdict":"confirmed","scope":"d4 §Thinking blocks are tied","evidence":[{"source":"d4","locator":"§Thinking blocks are tied","quote":"To drop the affected blocks instead, send the `thinking-binding-controls-2026-08-01` beta header and set `thinking.block_binding.prefix_mismatch_behavior` to `\"drop_block\"`. On older accounts, setting that field to either value opts the request in. `block_binding` works only with `thinking: {\"type\": \"adaptive\"}`. With `between_tools`, keep the history append-only, or strip the thinking blocks from the edited turn on."}]}
{"id":"c64","kind":"web","text":"computer use 는 toolset 으로 옮길 때 agent loop 도 member tool_use, batch action, toolset_name 에 맞게 고친다 (07, 14장)","verdict":"confirmed","scope":"d4 §computer_20251124","evidence":[{"source":"d4","locator":"§computer_20251124 is not supported","quote":"Drop the beta header, replace the `tools` entry with `{\"type\": \"computer_toolset_20260801\"}`, and update your agent loop for member `tool_use` blocks, batch actions, and `toolset_name` on results."}]}
{"id":"c65","kind":"web","text":"Terminal-Bench 와 CursorBench 차트는 GPT-6 Sol 값이 공개되지 않아 GPT-5.6 Sol 을 싣는다 (13장)","verdict":"confirmed","scope":"w1 §Performance · chart notes","evidence":[{"source":"w1","locator":"§Performance · Terminal-Bench chart note","quote":"Terminal-Bench and OpenAI did not report GPT-6 Sol performance publicly, so we report GPT-5.6 Sol here."}]}
{"id":"c66","kind":"web","text":"원문이 같은 effort 끼리 비교한 것은 FrontierCode high 에서 10점 높고 비용 약 1/15 인 한 곳이다 (17장)","verdict":"confirmed","scope":"w1 §Coding ¶1","evidence":[{"source":"w1","locator":"§Coding ¶1","quote":"At High effort on FrontierCode, it scores 10 points higher than Sonnet 5 at the same setting, at about one fifteenth of the cost per task. On CursorBench, which tests models on tasks from real Cursor coding sessions, its best score is within about two points of Opus 5.5."}]}
{"id":"c67","kind":"web","text":"Sonnet 5 코드는 thinking 응답 처리 세 항목 중 앞의 둘을 대개 갖췄다 (08장)","verdict":"confirmed","scope":"d1 §Handle thinking in responses","evidence":[{"source":"d1","locator":"§Handle thinking in responses","quote":"Code that ran without thinking needs all three items. Code from Claude Sonnet 5 likely has the first two."}]}
{"id":"c68","kind":"web","text":"원문 각주 3 은 영향이 있더라도 작다고, 각주 4 는 AA 벤치마크에 큰 영향이 없고 Chartography 는 영향이 없었다고 쓴다 (13장)","verdict":"confirmed","scope":"w1 §Footnotes 3, 4","evidence":[{"source":"w1","locator":"§Footnotes 3","quote":"We expect the effect on Sonnet 5.5’s scores, if any, to be small and to understate its performance."},{"source":"w1","locator":"§Footnotes 4","quote":"Artificial Analysis does not expect major impacts to AA-Briefcase v1.1 and GDPval-AA v2.1. Internal testing of Chartography suggests its score was not impacted."}]}
{"id":"c69","kind":"web","text":"Sonnet 5.5 의 thinking 블록을 읽는 다른 모델은 없다 (06장)","verdict":"confirmed","scope":"d4 §Thinking blocks are tied","evidence":[{"source":"d4","locator":"§Thinking blocks are tied ¶1","quote":"No other model reads Claude Sonnet 5.5 thinking blocks."}]}
{"id":"c70","kind":"web","text":"Sonnet 5.5 는 가장 강한 모델의 것과 비슷한 cyber 안전장치와 fallback 을 단 첫 Sonnet 이고 안전장치는 Opus 5.5 와 비슷하다 (03, 09장)","verdict":"confirmed","scope":"w1 §intro, §Safeguards","evidence":[{"source":"w1","locator":"§intro · Alignment and safety","quote":"Because its cybersecurity capabilities are comparable to Opus 5’s, it’s the first Sonnet model to launch with cyber safeguards and fallbacks like those we’ve developed for our most capable models. Its biology safeguards are the same as Sonnet 5’s."},{"source":"w1","locator":"§Safety · Safeguards · Cybersecurity","quote":"Sonnet 5.5’s cyber capabilities are a large improvement over Sonnet 5’s, so we’re deploying it with safeguards similar to those on Opus 5.5."}]}
